WEBVTT

00:03:27.296 --> 00:03:30.336
Nilikuwa nimenaswa kwenye kizimba
mateka kati ya watekaji,

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:32.256
nikipigania uhuru ambao sijawahi kuwa nao.

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:34.456
Nilikuwa nimepotea, nimechoka,

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.840
na sikuwa na machaguzi.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.776
Kwa hiyo nikiwa na miaka 20,

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:42.130
nilifanya kitu kigumu kuliko vyote
nilivyowahi kufanya maishani mwangu.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:43.360
Nilichukua kitabu,

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:47.880
na ilikuwa ni kipindi kigumu sana 
maishani mwangu.

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:51.136
kujaribu kujifunza jinsi ya kusoma,

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:53.776
kutengana na familia yangu,

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.000
na rafiki zangu.

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:57.736
Ilikuwa shida, mzee.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:59.136
Ilikuwa ni mahangaiko.

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:00.856
Lakini sikufahamu japo kidogo kuwa